:"J’ai laissé ma fierté derrière","t":82.58,"e":84.5,"w":[["J’ai",82.58,82.72],["laissé",82.76,83.16],["ma",83.24,83.36],["fierté",83.42,83.86],["derrière",83.92,84.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Au premier signe de ta voix","t":84.52,"e":86.04,"w":[["Au",84.52,84.6],["premier",84.66,85.02],["signe",85.14,85.38],["de",85.44,85.54],["ta",85.62,85.76],["voix",85.82,86.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais toi, tu passais sans me voir","t":86.4,"e":88.12,"w":[["Mais",86.4,86.5],["toi",86.54,86.68],["tu",86.76,86.9],["passais",87.02,87.4],["sans",87.5,87.66],["me",87.72,87.9],["voir",87.96,88.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Comme si j’étais déjà loin de toi","t":88.16,"e":89.82,"w":[["Comme",88.16,88.26],["si",88.32,88.4],["j’étais",88.42,88.72],["déjà",88.78,89.18],["loin",89.24,89.36],["de",89.42,89.5],["toi",89.58,89.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le goût amer de tes retours","t":90.2,"e":92.02,"w":[["Le",90.2,90.28],["goût",90.34,90.5],["amer",90.62,91.08],["de",91.12,91.22],["tes",91.26,91.4],["retours",91.48,92.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le froid des mains qui se retirent","t":92.08,"e":94.1,"w":[["Le",92.08,92.16],["froid",92.2,92.36],["des",92.42,92.62],["mains",92.7,92.96],["qui",93,93.1],["se",93.16,93.3],["retirent",93.38,94.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et pourtant, quand tout s’effondre","t":94.14,"e":95.9,"w":[["Et",94.14,94.26],["pourtant",94.32,94.82],["quand",94.9,95.02],["tout",95.06,95.16],["s’effondre",95.24,95.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est ton nom que je respire","t":95.98,"e":97.56,"w":[["C’est",95.98,96.14],["ton",96.2,96.38],["nom",96.48,96.7],["que",96.76,96.88],["je",96.94,97.08],["respire",97.14,97.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais je t’aime quand même","t":97.6,"e":98.78,"w":[["Mais",97.6,97.7],["je",97.74,97.84],["t’aime",97.9,98.16],["quand",98.2,98.34],["même",98.42,98.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oui, je t’aime quand même","t":99.48,"e":100.7,"w":[["Oui",99.48,99.58],["je",99.62,99.72],["t’aime",99.78,100.04],["quand",100.08,100.22],["même",100.28,100.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même si tu m’oub